    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac1cb9577f325562755df24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“那位”目白光明也在喔。 她还是一样悠哉……\n要是搞错进攻时机就输定了，她没问题吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0451f74836feed7235269c715bbd2b6f24c9ca9ca59cdf8e298e0276b0d581c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
