    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e81cef1ab0fb5c24b466252e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "暂定训练员大人～我准备好了。\n今天该怎么做呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7232d4250b365825805ae29a8290fceee6bb5c7defc614e3457080b967b5326",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1074/storytimeline_041074004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93201a4902a82ba3ed30c291",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能否忍耐住别在途中抢先往前冲将成为这场比赛的关键。\n要是在意秒数而打乱步调就会落入劣势。等关键时刻来临──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c774c7d6e561b53e42a18bab1bf1ed174c0e0b741672758b0a97316da46d94bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1074/storytimeline_041074004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf6aa738d5231d08a121b77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你可以的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d429d4af01a561e2127ccbcc664d587e61ef19828d0613e5018100243f12525e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1074/storytimeline_041074004.json",
