    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db4662ffee05752f294eb4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就依照练习时所做的，掌握时机一口气向前冲刺……对吧？\n……我真的跑得赢吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a153ceab66193ecd931a4b9fa56b3752c5186373f7c12ac1f2fedc616f5102",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
