    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7130140fc72933fd0949397c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在来到最后的直线！赛马娘们同时展开对决──\n哎呀！？此时目白光明从最后方窜出！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a6388081dad91c2c0916d368e732b4513c08afc1f3b45e0a9355e15d46c41b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
