    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9be14393e69f80257a3548",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目前相处下来让我清楚知道，她并不会因为\n一点小批评就动摇。但今天好像不太一样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9387b5c8e451680dbcf6681c181ec484f43e8b72d3db25f003c4970ef3afee1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
