      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两、两分钟……！？才1800米耶！？\n好、好慢啊……！比平均值多了将近十秒钟……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd05abc2923a7d18734add9855a7d1d1c47f85ba02d0340404cc3213129e4eaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
