      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我看见了。我看见你的坚强……还有决心。\n我也……得向前迈进才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32ef0c75160aa949adbb2f75013fad3936a1a3273929f19b556147023ce77ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
