      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回来了，暂定训练员大人～\n……我赢得胜利了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6fea602ceea25ff796cd1ac7c4ed4e659d0c44c2bff98d83d2e3cee8836f212",
