    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35abfa239b5e51a0f1c97c9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的时间的确比别人慢。但维持缓慢步调，最后再用尾段加速\n超前的跑法，即使在最高层级的比赛中也无疑是强力的武器！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a7e70351512f46f5518881715a60447dff29210a20a51a88144aab8cb34ac7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
