      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要好好锻炼，未来一定能表现得更好──想到这里……\n我突然惊觉自己很想亲眼看看她这道光芒将照映出何种未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f784baa82444c6358bd96ab0bb0e1795a1676b318e4ba4543ba065fa02f841e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
